{"id":"08ef036c-cb64-4578-9a27-a91cb93d7395","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:47:00.172Z","batchId":"profile_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"profile","prompt":"A user profile card with avatar, name, role, short bio, a few stats and a follow button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-name\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Available for work</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"More profile actions\">•••</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Maya Chen\">MC</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h1 id=\"profile-name\" class=\"h2\">Maya Chen</h1>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Senior Product Designer</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Product designer focused on making complex tools feel simple, useful, and human. Currently crafting thoughtful experiences for teams that work together.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button id=\"follow-button\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Follow</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Message</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\" aria-label=\"Profile statistics\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Projects</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">48</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Followers</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">12.4k</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Following</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">386</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between center\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Based in San Francisco, CA</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Joined March 2021</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const followButton = document.getElementById('follow-button');\n  followButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const isFollowing = followButton.getAttribute('aria-pressed') === 'true';\n    followButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!isFollowing));\n    followButton.textContent = isFollowing ? 'Follow' : 'Following';\n    followButton.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', !isFollowing);\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[8380,"<div"],[8483," class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"card stack gap"],[8601,"-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-name\">\n    <div class"],[8680,"=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <span"],[8785," class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Available for work</span>\n     "],[8902," <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-label"],[9082,"=\"More profile actions\">•••"],[9222,"</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n"],[9325,"      <div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Maya Chen\">MC"],[9429,"</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n       "],[9542," <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h1 id=\"profile-name\""],[9645," class=\"h2\">Maya Chen</h1>\n          <p class=\""],[9746,"muted\">Senior Product Designer</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class"],[9863,"=\"card-desc\">Product designer focused on making complex tools"],[10055," feel simple, useful, and human. Curren